## PHASE 1 — SYLLABUS VERIFICATION

Verify the current official JAMB Biology syllabus.

Do not generate lesson notes yet.

## PHASE 2 — SYLLABUS AUDIT

Produce:

1. Verified syllabus hierarchy
2. Major topics
3. Subtopics
4. Proposed lessons
5. Lesson IDs
6. Lesson-to-syllabus mapping
7. Difficulty
8. Estimated study time
9. Prerequisites
10. Scope classification
11. Missing areas
12. Duplicate areas
13. Fragmentation issues
14. Oversized topics
15. Supporting concepts
16. VERIFY areas
17. OUTSIDE_SCOPE areas
18. Recommended corrections
19. Final corrected lesson count

## PHASE 3 — STOP

After presenting the complete audit, STOP.

Ask exactly:

**APPROVE CURRICULUM**

Do not generate actual lessons before approval.

